if(s)return"\ud83d\udc65 **Complete JJAASS Water Market Role Guide**\n\n1. **Station Admin (Web Admin Panel)**:\n   - **Dashboard & Orders**: Monitor live orders, assign drivers, and update statuses.\n   - **Defect & Swap Claims**: Inspect customer photo evidence, approve/decline swap claims, and click **Complete Transaction & Dismiss** (or let completed orders auto-dismiss).\n   - **Inventory & 10,000L Reservoir**: Manage water stock, Slim/Round containers, and track **Customer Borrowed Gallons**.\n   - **Deliveries, Payments & Reports**: Track live driver GPS fleet, verify GCash/COD payments, and export **CSV / PDF** reports.\n   - **Settings & Compliance Permits**: Upload/replace Mayor's Permit, DOH Sanitary Permit, Lab Tests, DTI, and FSIC directly from a laptop.\n\n2. **Delivery Driver (Mobile App)**:\n   - **Job Invitations**: Accept single jobs or tap **Accept All** to accept all pending dispatches with real-time order prices.\n   - **Live GPS Navigation**: View customer pinned coordinates, optimize multi-stop routes, and progress status (`Assigned` \u2192 `Out for Delivery` \u2192 `Delivered`).\n   - **Gallon Returns & Payments**: Log returned Slim/Round borrowed gallons, verify GCash/COD, and message Customer or **Station Admin Desk**.\n\n3. **Customer (Mobile App)**:\n   - **Order Water**: Order Refills (\u20b130) or Set A w/ New Jug (\u20b1230), choose 5-Gallon Slim or Round, pin house GPS, and pay via **GCash (PayMongo)** or **COD**.\n   - **Track & Chat**: Track the rider on the live map and chat with the Driver or Station Admin.\n   - **Defect Claims & Permits**: Submit defect claims with **Camera/Gallery photo evidence**, redeem approved free swaps, and view official **Station Safety Permits**."
